                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                        "entry_id": "3b010ab5-9ec5-3be8-aa07-3bd770cc2fe9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inclined to showing (by conveying an impression so that events are described in the narrative), instead of telling (by explicitly stating facts)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6940f3d6-d08c-46e6-bf3a-97fd8ad38cf8",
                                                "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                                "text": "I think my problem with it is that it's\na) a little \"telly\" not \"showy\" in comparison to the rest […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "291d4228-9b4e-4763-9d8b-016f7a99fce4",
                                                "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                                "text": "There's a way to make this more showy and less telly. It's like you're in a hurry to get on with the rest of the story."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1496d3fc-b0b4-47ef-a00c-1e7550ad79f4",
                                                "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                                "text": "story is too, too telly; need at least 3 showy scenes to improve showing:telling ratio"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "204c305f-0e87-4d39-bf42-85029c76e921",
                                                "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                                "text": "Six of Crows is very telly and little showy. You are constantly getting info dumps and mini-flashbacks to the characters past."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99aeaa4e-8286-4072-8081-643ff0a62d2b",
                                                "sense_id": "fb99976c-32ff-3c94-aaff-cd464406eb41",
                                                "text": "The ending felt rushed to me, and I wish it would have been more showy and less telly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
